1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,500
Stop fighting slide layout boxes in traditional presentation tools.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,800
Meet Markdeck: Write Markdown, get slides instantly.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Real-time split-view editing with live 16:9 canvas synchronization.

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Have an existing deck? Drag and drop any .md file directly from your Mac.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Press ⌘ + Enter to step into distraction-free presentation mode.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:31,000
Fluid 60fps transitions powered by Framer Motion. Native keyboard navigation.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,000
Designed with Apple Human Interface Guidelines and optical typography.

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:41,500
Interactive reactions: Press 'C' anytime to celebrate with confetti on stage.

9
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:46,000
Press Escape to return to the workspace.

10
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:53,500
Full keyboard shortcuts, speaker notes, and 1-click PDF export via ⌘ + P.

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Markdeck — Presentations as Code. Try it live today at ss20112006.github.io/Markdeck.
